  "text": "### Closing Procedures (17:00 PM)  \n**Last 30 Minutes:**  \n1. **Customer Management**\n- [ ] Last admission: 16:55 PM\n- [ ] Announce closing: \"We close in 10 minutes\"\n- [ ] Do not start new transactions after 16:55 PM  \n2. **Cash Handling**\n- [ ] Collect cash from all teller drawers\n- [ ] Count and verify (must match previous count)\n- [ ] Secure cash in vault\n- [ ] Count and seal cash for night deposit (if >£10,000)\n- [ ] Record closing balance\n- [ ] Lock vault  \n3. **System Shutdown**\n- [ ] Log out of all customer systems\n- [ ] Verify no transactions pending\n- [ ] Shut down computers gracefully\n- [ ] Wait for systems to fully shut down\n- [ ] Verify no sensitive data on screens  \n4. **Physical Closure**\n- [ ] Collect all customer files\n- [ ] File papers in secure location\n- [ ] Empty and shred trash\n- [ ] Lock all office doors\n- [ ] Turn off lights\n- [ ] Verify entrance/exit doors locked\n- [ ] Arm alarm system (code: [SECURITY CODE])\n- [ ] Record closure time and staff names  \n**Manager Sign-Off:** Verify branch closed properly and all cash reconciled  \n---",
  "name": "Chunk 5/25",
  "domain": "banking_communications",
